        "sourceTextSha256": "5531e7d8913a0d6183014456db82200d5e0369e8b28e5504e6119202de61cf8e",
        "text": "\n## Price per person, USD\n\n| Party size | Occupancy | Price |\n|---|---|---:|\n| 1 person | SGL | $10254 |\n| 2 people | SGL | $7240 |\n| 2 people | DBL | $5506 |\n| 3 people | SGL | $6958 |\n| 3 people | DBL | $5224 |\n| 3 people | TRL | $5096 |\n\nSGL means single occupancy, DBL double occupancy and TRL triple occupancy. Prices in the table are per person. These rates apply to the 2026 programme. Flights are paid for separately.\n\n## Accommodation along the route\n\nBuenos Aires: 4-star 474 Buenos Aires, 3 nights at the start and 1 night before departure. El Calafate: 4-star Calafate Parque, 2 nights. Ushuaia: 4-star Wyndham Garden Ushuaia, 2 nights. Bariloche: 4-star Rochester Bariloche, 2 nights. Iguazu region: 4-star Mercure Iguazu, 3 nights; the location and cross-border transfers are confirmed at booking.\n",
